DevOps Interview Preparation Series — System Design for DevOps & SRE Engineers 🚀

Let’s dive deep into how DevOps/SRE professionals should approach System Design 👇

System Design Interviews Questions for DevOps/SRE.

 How would you design a highly available architecture on AWS or GCP?
 What factors would you consider while choosing between EC2, ECS, or EKS?
 How do you ensure disaster recovery and backup for critical systems?
 How would you design multi-region or active-active architectures?
CI/CD Pipeline Design
 How do you design a CI/CD pipeline that supports multiple environments ?
 How do you ensure security (DevSecOps) in the pipeline?
 What tools and strategies would you use for zero-downtime deployment? (Blue/Green, Canary)
 How do you handle rollbacks and version control of deployments?
Monitoring & Observability
 How do you design a complete monitoring stack (Prometheus, Grafana, CloudWatch)?
 How do you design alerting thresholds and reduce alert fatigue?
 What’s your strategy to achieve 99.9% uptime via observability?
 How do you centralize logs and correlate across microservices?
Scaling & Performance
 How do you scale a microservice-based application?
 How would you handle a sudden traffic spike (10x user load)?
 How do you implement caching (Redis, CloudFront) and rate limiting?
 How do you design an auto-scaling mechanism with health checks?
Reliability & Fault Tolerance
 How do you implement circuit breakers, retries, and graceful degradation?
 What’s your strategy to handle instance or node failure in production?
 How do you design an incident response workflow and postmortem process?
 How do you define and measure SLOs, SLIs, and SLAs for reliability?
Security & Compliance
 How do you integrate vulnerability scanning in your CI/CD pipeline?
 How would you design IAM and least privilege access across cloud accounts?
 How do you ensure data encryption (in-transit & at-rest) across services?
 How would you handle secret management at scale (Vault, Secrets Manager)?
Automation & Infrastructure as Code (IaC)
 How would you design an IaC-based infrastructure using Terraform or CloudFormation?
 How do you handle drift detection and versioning of IaC?
 How do you design a GitOps-based deployment flow using ArgoCD or Flux?
 How do you integrate automated testing and policy enforcement (OPA, Conftest)?
Cost Optimization & Governance
 How would you design a cost-efficient environment that scales dynamically?
 How do you implement governance using tagging and budget alerts?
 How do you track idle resources and optimize cloud spend automatically?
Design a system to automatically deploy microservices to Kubernetes.
Design a multi-region web app with failover and data replication.
Design a CI/CD system with security scanning and rollback capabilities.
